# foreign_ns.claim — WHICH NAMESPACES ARE NOT THE LOGOS ENTITY NAMESPACE.
#
# A regex over a callee's QUALIFIED name. A callee declared in one of these is
# a LIBRARY api: `std::string::find_first_of("eE")` is a character-set search,
# not an entity resolution, and `resolver_pat`'s `^find_.*` matches it purely
# by spelling. Splitting the claim's over-match OUT is what makes the rest of
# the count mean something.
#
# ⚠ FOREIGN IS NOT AUTOMATICALLY BENIGN and the rule does not say it is: it is
# a SEPARATE column. `mlir::…::lookupSymbol` is foreign AND a real resolution —
# of an already-mangled symbol, which is why it lands benign for a different
# reason, stated per row.
^std::.*
^__gnu_cxx::.*
^llvm::.*
^mlir::.*
